ou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_class_names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18497508/test_class_names.zip)\r\nThis project includes a `generate.sh` script that can be used to create projects with lots of `class_name`s with custom icons.[^1]\r\n\r\n[^1]: Same project without the pregenerated classes in case you have trouble extracting it: [test_class_names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18497515/test_class_names.zip)\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an optimized (LTO) editor build.\r\n\r\nIn a project with 10,000 named classes that have their own icon each, this is the delay before the Create New Node dialog shows up after clicking the button:\r\n\r\nCold:\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n4.1 seconds | 1.6 seconds\r\n\r\nWarm:\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n0.9 seconds | 0.3 seconds","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#pullrequestreview-2565872226","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101489","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-21T23:13:18Z"},{"id":2567073993,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZAnDJ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"pub